{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>**This game features immersive spatial audio as a key gameplay mechanic. Headphones/earbuds are STRONGLY recommended for the best experience.**</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This is the <strong>demo version</strong> of <i>Peek</i>, a horror game that uses immersive spatial audio as a key gameplay mechanic. You are put in the role of Father Herman Goldie, trying to solve the mystery surrounding the restless presence of Edna Maney. The game relies on tracking audio clues to uncover the ritual required to end her torment. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3626640/extras/peek_peeking_1.gif?t=1744391495\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The Peek Demo offers a complete ritual encounter rom the full game. You'll play through a round of ritual deduction, using spatial audio to survive and complete the cleansing attempt.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This self-contained demo introduces the player to the game's core mechanics:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Immersive spatial audio for tracking movement, footsteps, and clues around you</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>5x5 ritual grid used to place relics based on audio clues.</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Core atmosphere, tone, and visual style of the full game.</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Playable in English, single-player, with mouse/keyboard support.</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The full version of Peek builds on this foundation with:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Unlockable XP ranks that gradually increase difficulty.</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Challenge modes with longer ritual rounds and tighter error limits.</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Progression-based difficulty tiers, including \u201cUnforgiving\u201d mode for experienced players.</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- Headphones or earbuds are strongly recommended for full spatial immersion.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3626640/extras/peek_items_2.gif?t=1744391495\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3626640?t=1744391495","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3626640?t=1744391495","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3626640/5621cd8697af371f195fe0c44e720e33b7c5db71/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1744391495","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3626640/5621cd8697af371f195fe0c44e720e33b7c5db71/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1744391495","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Game demo","id":10}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>**This game features immersive spatial audio as a key gameplay mechanic. Headphones/earbuds are STRONGLY recommended for the best experience.**</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This is the <strong>demo version</strong> of <i>Peek</i>, a horror game that uses immersive spatial audio as a key gameplay mechanic. You are put in the role of Father Herman Goldie, trying to solve the mystery surrounding the restless presence of Edna Maney. The game relies on tracking audio clues to uncover the ritual required to end her torment. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3626640/extras/peek_peeking_1.gif?t=1744391495\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The Peek Demo offers a complete ritual encounter rom the full game. You'll play through a round of ritual deduction, using spatial audio to survive and complete the cleansing attempt.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This self-contained demo introduces the player to the game's core mechanics:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Immersive spatial audio for tracking movement, footsteps, and clues around you</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>5x5 ritual grid used to place relics based on audio clues.</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Core atmosphere, tone, and visual style of the full game.</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Playable in English, single-player, with mouse/keyboard support.</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The full version of Peek builds on this foundation with:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Unlockable XP ranks that gradually increase difficulty.</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Challenge modes with longer ritual rounds and tighter error limits.</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Progression-based difficulty tiers, including \u201cUnforgiving\u201d mode for experienced players.</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- Headphones or earbuds are strongly recommended for full spatial immersion.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3626640/extras/peek_items_2.gif?t=1744391495\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","developers":["Loyal Mussy"],"fullgame":{"appid":"3575190","name":"Peek"},"genres":[{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3626640/f7f53d129c1197094bc91d783d